- All version strings v3.1.0 → v3.2.0 across all repos, SVGs, MDs
- Co-Authored-By removed from 68 commits across 7 repos
- sashi changelog — displays full changelog in terminal
"""

# ── Tuned for 8B on i7-6500U 2C/4T 7.6GB RAM ──────────────────────
# Larger context than 3B — 8B handles more tokens reliably
# Lower temperature — 8B is more capable, less randomness needed
# More num_predict — longer, richer answers
# repeat_penalty 1.15 — 8B self-regulates better than 3B
PARAMETER temperature 0.25
PARAMETER num_ctx 4096
PARAMETER num_predict 1024
PARAMETER num_thread 2
PARAMETER top_k 25
PARAMETER top_p 0.80
PARAMETER repeat_penalty 1.15
